close_reason: "All eight CodeRabbit findings addressed: guarded the --showConfig parse against empty/non-JSON stdout; made captureOutput async so post-await logs are captured; replaced the typeof-score assert.ok with strictEqual; rewrote the assert.ok(true) fallback test to assert Total items: 0 and no status line; deleted the duplicated vector-store upsert test; asserted buildFixture status===0 and rethrow createFixture symlink errors unless the target exists; used path.delimiter and skip-on-Windows for the fake-npx test; confirmed the no-lcov test is deterministic (20x standalone + 20x shuffled full suite, 20/20 each). Mutation checks prove findings 3 and 4 now fail on broken behaviour."
